      heading: "Personal note 🌷",
      paragraphs: [
        "I don't think TypeScript makes someone a better developer. Good architecture, good naming, and good communication still matter.",
        "But TypeScript removes uncertainty. Instead of guessing what a variable should contain, the code tells you.",
        "Instead of finding bugs in production, you find them while writing the feature. And honestly... I sleep a little better because of that."
      ]
